{
  "id": "916",
  "title": "Are surgical masks sold here?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-04-04",
  "synopsis": "Ben tries to buy surgical masks at a supermarket.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/916/8941f08e4392625cb4a8d9834d0743500ce65ab4.mp3?1585482453",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "这里有口罩卖吗？\n\n（在超市）\n本：你好，这里有口罩卖吗？\n售货员：对不起，我们这里没有。\n本：请问哪里可以买到呢？\n售货员：你要先在手机上预约，然后去药店买。\n本：怪不得我去了很多店都买不到。\n售货员：因为现在生病的人很多，大家出门都要口罩，所以统一销售。\n本：好吧，我还想要鸡蛋，这里有吗？\n售货员：有的。你看，就在那儿！\n本：谢谢，我看到了。希望中国快快好起来！\n售货员：谢谢您！",
    "traditional": "這裡有口罩賣嗎？\n\n（在超市）\n本：你好，這裡有口罩賣嗎？\n售貨員：對不起，我們這裡沒有。\n本：請問哪裏可以買到呢？\n售貨員：你要先在手機上預約，然後去藥店買。\n本：怪不得我去了很多店都買不到。\n售貨員：因為現在生病的人很多，大家出門都要口罩，所以統一銷售。\n本：好吧，我還想要雞蛋，這裡有嗎？\n售貨員：有的。你看，就在那兒！\n本：謝謝，我看到了。希望中國快快好起來！\n售貨員：謝謝您！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are surgical masks sold here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "（在超市）",
      "traditional": "（在超市）",
      "pinyin": "zài chāo shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(In the supermarket)"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：你好，这里有口罩卖吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你好，這裡有口罩賣嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ hǎo zhè lǐ yǒu kǒu zhào mài ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello, are surgical masks sold here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "售货员：对不起，我们这里没有。",
      "traditional": "售貨員：對不起，我們這裡沒有。",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán duì bu qǐ wǒ men zhè lǐ méi yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop assistant: I’m sorry, we don’t have any here."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：请问哪里可以买到呢？",
      "traditional": "本：請問哪裏可以買到呢？",
      "pinyin": "běn qǐng wèn nǎ lǐ kě yǐ mǎi dào ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: May I ask where I can buy them?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "售货员：你要先在手机上预约，然后去药店买。",
      "traditional": "售貨員：你要先在手機上預約，然後去藥店買。",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán nǐ yào xiān zài shǒu jī shang yù yuē rán hòu qù yào diàn mǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop assistant: You must first reserve them on your phone, and then go to the pharmacy to purchase them."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：怪不得我去了很多店都买不到。",
      "traditional": "本：怪不得我去了很多店都買不到。",
      "pinyin": "běn guài bu de wǒ qù le hěn duō diàn dōu mǎi bú dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: No wonder I wasn’t able to buy them despite going to many shops."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "售货员：因为现在生病的人很多，大家出门都要口罩，所以统一销售。",
      "traditional": "售貨員：因為現在生病的人很多，大家出門都要口罩，所以統一銷售。",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán yīn wèi xiàn zài shēng bìng de rén hěn duō dà jiā chū mén dōu yào kǒu zhào suǒ yǐ tǒng yī xiāo shòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop assistant: Because currently many people are sick, everyone needs a surgical mask when they leave home, so they’re sold centrally."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：好吧，我还想要鸡蛋，这里有吗？",
      "traditional": "本：好吧，我還想要雞蛋，這裡有嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo ba wǒ hái xiǎng yào jī dàn zhè lǐ yǒu ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright. I also want to buy eggs, are there any here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "售货员：有的。你看，就在那儿！",
      "traditional": "售貨員：有的。你看，就在那兒！",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán yǒu de nǐ kàn jiù zài nà'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop assistant: Yes, we have them. Look, they’re just over there!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "本：谢谢，我看到了。希望中国快快好起来！",
      "traditional": "本：謝謝，我看到了。希望中國快快好起來！",
      "pinyin": "běn xiè xie wǒ kàn dào le xī wàng zhōng guó kuài kuài hǎo qǐ lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Thanks, I see them. I hope China gets better soon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "售货员：谢谢您！",
      "traditional": "售貨員：謝謝您！",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán xiè xie nín",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop assistant: Thank you!"
    }
  ],
